   "source": [
    "2. Transformación y variables nuevas\n",
    "\n",
    "| Variable | Cómo se construye | Para qué se usa |\n",
    "|---|---|---|\n",
    "| Plataforma_Nombre | Código a nombre completo, como X360 a Xbox 360 | Dashboard |\n",
    "| Fabricante | Empresa dueña de la plataforma | H3, dashboard |\n",
    "| Tipo_Plataforma | Sobremesa, portátil o PC | Dashboar |\n",
    "| Generacion | Generación de consolas (2 a 8) | Tendencias |\n",
    "| Decada | Década del lanzamiento | Filtros |\n",
    "| First_Party | Publisher = fabricante de la plataforma | H3, KPI |\n",
    "| Region_Dominante | Región con más ventas entre NA, EU y JP | H2 |\n",
    "| Share_NA/EU/JP/Otros | Participación de cada región en las ventas del título | H2, KPI |\n",
    "| Exito_1M | Título con 1 M o más de unidades | KPI tasa de hits |\n",
    "| Genero | Género traducido | Dashboard |"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 10,
   "id": "fb7c7cd6",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-18T02:27:23.515304Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-18T02:27:23.515098Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-18T02:27:23.535401Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-10-18T02:27:23.534011Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "plataformas = {\n",
    "    # codigo: (nombre, fabricante, tipo, generacion)\n",
    "    \"2600\": (\"Atari 2600\", \"Atari\", \"Sobremesa\", 2),\n",
    "    \"NES\": (\"NES\", \"Nintendo\", \"Sobremesa\", 3),\n",
    "    \"SNES\": (\"Super Nintendo\", \"Nintendo\", \"Sobremesa\", 4),\n",
    "    \"GEN\": (\"Sega Genesis\", \"Sega\", \"Sobremesa\", 4),\n",
    "    \"SCD\": (\"Sega CD\", \"Sega\", \"Sobremesa\", 4),\n",
    "    \"TG16\": (\"TurboGrafx-16\", \"NEC\", \"Sobremesa\", 4),\n",
    "    \"NG\": (\"Neo Geo\", \"SNK\", \"Sobremesa\", 4),\n",
    "    \"GB\": (\"Game Boy\", \"Nintendo\", \"Portátil\", 4),\n",
    "    \"GG\": (\"Game Gear\", \"Sega\", \"Portátil\", 4),\n",
    "    \"PS\": (\"PlayStation\", \"Sony\", \"Sobremesa\", 5),\n",
    "    \"N64\": (\"Nintendo 64\", \"Nintendo\", \"Sobremesa\", 5),\n",
    "    \"SAT\": (\"Sega Saturn\", \"Sega\", \"Sobremesa\", 5),\n",
    "    \"3DO\": (\"3DO\", \"Panasonic\", \"Sobremesa\", 5),\n",
    "    \"PCFX\": (\"PC-FX\", \"NEC\", \"Sobremesa\", 5),\n",
    "    \"WS\": (\"WonderSwan\", \"Bandai\", \"Portátil\", 5),\n",
    "    \"PS2\": (\"PlayStation 2\", \"Sony\", \"Sobremesa\", 6),\n",
    "    \"XB\": (\"Xbox\", \"Microsoft\", \"Sobremesa\", 6),\n",
    "    \"GC\": (\"GameCube\", \"Nintendo\", \"Sobremesa\", 6),\n",
    "    \"DC\": (\"Dreamcast\", \"Sega\", \"Sobremesa\", 6),\n",
    "    \"GBA\": (\"Game Boy Advance\", \"Nintendo\", \"Portátil\", 6),\n",
    "    \"PS3\": (\"PlayStation 3\", \"Sony\", \"Sobremesa\", 7),\n",
    "    \"X360\": (\"Xbox 360\", \"Microsoft\", \"Sobremesa\", 7),\n",
    "    \"Wii\": (\"Wii\", \"Nintendo\", \"Sobremesa\", 7),\n",
    "    \"DS\": (\"Nintendo DS\", \"Nintendo\", \"Portátil\", 7),\n",
    "    \"PSP\": (\"PSP\", \"Sony\", \"Portátil\", 7),\n",
    "    \"PS4\": (\"PlayStation 4\", \"Sony\", \"Sobremesa\", 8),\n",
    "    \"XOne\": (\"Xbox One\", \"Microsoft\", \"Sobremesa\", 8),\n",
    "    \"WiiU\": (\"Wii U\", \"Nintendo\", \"Sobremesa\", 8),\n",
    "    \"3DS\": (\"Nintendo 3DS\", \"Nintendo\", \"Portátil\", 8),\n",
    "    \"PSV\": (\"PS Vita\", \"Sony\", \"Portátil\", 8),\n",
    "    \"PC\": (\"PC\", \"PC\", \"PC\", np.nan),\n",
    "}\n",
    "assert set(df[\"Platform\"]) <= set(plataformas), \"falta mapear alguna plataforma\"\n",
    "\n",
    "info = pd.DataFrame.from_dict(plataformas, orient=\"index\",\n",
    "                              columns=[\"Plataforma_Nombre\", \"Fabricante\", \"Tipo_Plataforma\", \"Generacion\"])\n",
    "df = df.merge(info, left_on=\"Platform\", right_index=True, how=\"left\")\n",
    "df[\"Decada\"] = (df[\"Year\"] // 10 * 10).astype(str) + \"s\"\n",
    "df[\"Genero\"] = df[\"Genre\"].map(estilo.GENERO_ES)"
   ]
  },
